<title>USA: MarkWest Hydro sets stock buyback program.</title>
<headline>MarkWest Hydro sets stock buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MarkWest Hydrocarbon Inc said Friday that its board of directors approved a program to repurchase up to a total of 250,000 shares of the company's stock during 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>The company had 8,485,000 shares outstanding as of March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The purpose of the repurchase program is to provide for potential stock option exercises of MarkWest management and employees, it said.</p>
</text>
